 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Each sample is \"<time>:<f1->f2->...>\" with strictly increasing integer times; an empty stack is allowed. A frame instance at depth d continues from one sample to the next iff the stacks agree on positions 0..d (so recursion and re-entry are distinguished by position). The interval [t_i, t_{i+1}) is charged to the innermost function of sample i (if any); the last sample charges nothing. Return [name, exclusive time] for every name seen, sorted by name.",
